  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/dom/nodes/insertion-removing-steps/script-does-not-run-on-child-removal.window.js\n\nTests that child removal does not remove script, which gecko chromium and webkit all follow.\n\nBut from what I understand the last assertion fails when following spec as script execution is triggered from the [children changed steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#script-processing-model:children-changed-steps) / [post connection](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#script-processing-model:html-element-post-connection-steps)\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1288 relates to this",
